diff --git a/docs/todo/blade.md b/docs/todo/blade.md
index 3fd08eb..0dddf13 100644
--- a/docs/todo/blade.md
+++ b/docs/todo/blade.md
@@ -155,3 +155,23 @@ qualified class name, a Livewire template (whose body is a method of a
 synthesized subclass), and a CRLF template.
 
 **Deliverable:** Code actions are re-enabled for `.blade.php` files.
+
+## BL2. Accurate cyclic Blade data transformations
+
+**Impact: Medium · Complexity: High**
+
+Recursive include/component graphs can transform a value at each edge, for
+example by passing `['person' => [$person]]`. Repeated substitution can grow
+an unbounded nested type; iteration until textual equality, a fixed retry
+count, and blanket `mixed` widening do not establish the correct type.
+
+Use the shared type engine to represent recursive/provenance types or derive
+a sound transfer model. Preserve explicit data, local assignments, loop
+bindings, annotations, composers and omitted fields. Distinguish
+class and anonymous component props/slots from ordinary view seeds, and
+evaluate type-changing annotations at their actual render edges. Tests must distinguish
+true strongly connected members from downstream consumers, retire unsupported
+old contributions after caller changes, and reject stale staged publications.
+Transparent implicit forwarding is only a finite special case; it does not
+complete this task. Unsupported transforms must remain explicitly unresolved,
+without presenting historical cached types as newly verified current facts.
