--- a/docs/todo/laravel.md
+++ b/docs/todo/laravel.md
@@ -799,3 +799,18 @@ constructor injection doesn't apply.
 **Where to look:** `code_actions/` for the promote-to-constructor
 pattern already used elsewhere; `virtual_members/laravel/facade.rs`
 for the facade-to-concrete-class resolution to reuse.
+
+#### L60. Laravel 13 higher-order `sole` proxy
+
+**Impact: Low-Medium · Complexity: Medium**
+
+Laravel 13.37 adds `sole` to `Collection::$proxies`. The example assertion's
+expected proxy list matches Laravel 12.70, but misses this installed-version
+addition. `virtual_members/laravel/higher_order_proxy.rs::plan_result` also
+falls through to `mixed` for `sole`, rather than the matched item type.
+
+Add installed-version-aware coverage and preserve the method's real success
+return type and exception behavior. Verify property and method proxy forms
+on support/Eloquent collections and distinguish Laravel versions that do not
+offer this proxy. Update the example assertion with the implementation;
+removing the failing comparison alone would conceal the inference gap.
